{
  "name": "ultimate-frontend-skills",
  "version": "6.10.0",
  "description": "Ultimate Frontend Skills (UFS) for Claude Code and Codex. One route from brief to shipped page: a corpus of award-winning reference sites to decide against, WebGL gradients, real three-plane parallax, procedural and Blender-modelled three.js exploded views, CC0 PBR materials and HDRI lighting, scroll choreography, and an audit that fails the usual AI-generated tells.",
